<!--
  LINE Notify+ v1.1.1 launcher icon foreground

  Based on v1 Original design, with three refinements:
    1. Green "+" centered at canvas center (54, 54)
    2. Gear hub at gear geometric center (path fix: M5.7,2.6 -> M6,2.6)
    3. EVERYTHING uniformly scaled 1.1x to preserve original proportions.

